Note, filling an HTML template with placeholders.
Note, the template understands both double and single curly braces.
Note, run this from the project folder so that the template is found.

Let visitors be 0.

Define show page that takes request, do the following.
Add 1 to visitors.
Let name be the query parameter name of request.
Read the file examples slash template.html and store it in page.
Let page be the value of page with placeholder title replaced by My homepage.
Let page be the value of page with placeholder name replaced by the value of name.
Let page be the value of page with placeholder count replaced by the value of visitors.
Set content type to html.
Respond with the value of page.
End define.

Add route GET slash to show page.

Start a webserver on port 8092.
Say Open localhost 8092 in your browser and add a name to the address.
Wait for connections.
